<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Admin — Admin Settings — mockup</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bungee&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0b0a14; --bg-mid: #171129; --bg-deep2: #241a3d;
    --ink: #f4f1fb; --ink-dim: #a89fc9;
    --red: #ff4d5e; --orange: #ff9838; --yellow: #ffd54a;
    --green: #35d68f; --blue: #3fa8ff; --purple: #b874ff;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; }
  .display { font-family: 'Bungee', cursive; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }

  .stripe-bar { height: 5px; display: flex; }
  .stripe-bar span { flex: 1; }
  .stripe-bar .s1 { background: var(--red); } .stripe-bar .s2 { background: var(--orange); }
  .stripe-bar .s3 { background: var(--yellow); } .stripe-bar .s4 { background: var(--green); }
  .stripe-bar .s5 { background: var(--blue); } .stripe-bar .s6 { background: var(--purple); }

  nav { background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.12); }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .wordmark { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.2; }
  .wordmark small { display: block; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--ink-dim); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-top: 3px; }
  .admin-pill { font-family: 'Bungee', cursive; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--bg); background: var(--purple); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }

  .shell { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start; }

  .sidebar { background: var(--bg-mid); border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; position: sticky; top: 24px; }
  .sidebar .label { font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .sidebar a { display: block; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--ink-dim); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .sidebar a.active { background: rgba(184,116,255,0.14); color: var(--purple); font-weight: 600; }
  .sidebar .divider-line { height: 1px; background: rgba(244,241,251,0.1); margin: 12px 0; }

  .main h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .main > p.sub { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 28px; }

  .card { background: var(--bg-mid); border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .card-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .card-sub { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 18px; }

  .admin-row {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    background: rgba(244,241,251,0.02);
  }
  .admin-row .who { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .admin-row .email { font-size: 0.92rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .admin-row .added { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .you-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bg); background: var(--yellow);
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .remove-btn {
    background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(255,77,94,0.4); color: var(--red);
    width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1;
  }
  .remove-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; border-color: rgba(244,241,251,0.15); color: var(--ink-dim);
  }

  .add-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .add-row input {
    flex: 1; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.92rem; padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.16); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(11,10,20,0.6); color: var(--ink);
  }
  .btn-add {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #1a0a0a;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--orange), var(--red)); padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 16px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-dim); background: rgba(184,116,255,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184,116,255,0.2); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px;
  }

  footer { background: var(--bg); padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 20px; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sidebar { position: static; }
    .add-row { flex-direction: column; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#" class="wordmark display">SF LGBT BOWLERS
      <small>WEDNESDAY COMMUNITY BOWLING</small>
    </a>
    <span class="admin-pill">ADMIN — allisushi@gmail.com</span>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="stripe-bar"><span class="s1"></span><span class="s2"></span><span class="s3"></span><span class="s4"></span><span class="s5"></span><span class="s6"></span></div>

<div class="shell">
  <div class="sidebar">
    <div class="label">LGBT Wednesday Community</div>
    <a href="#">Season Setup</a>
    <a href="#">Weekly Standing Sheet</a>
    <a href="#">Schedule</a>
    <div class="divider-line"></div>
    <div class="label">Site-wide</div>
    <a href="#" class="active">Admin Settings</a>
    <a href="#">&larr; Back to dashboard</a>
  </div>

  <div class="main">
    <h1 class="display">Admin Settings</h1>
    <p class="sub">Manage who has admin access across the whole site — not scoped to one league.</p>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Admins</div>
      <div class="card-sub">Anyone signed in with one of these emails gets full admin access, including season setup and weekly uploads.</div>

      <div class="admin-row">
        <div class="who">
          <span class="email">allisushi@gmail.com</span>
          <span class="you-tag">You</span>
        </div>
        <button class="remove-btn" disabled title="You can't remove yourself while signed in">&times;</button>
      </div>

      <div class="add-row">
        <input type="email" placeholder="newadmin@example.com">
        <button class="btn-add">Add admin</button>
      </div>

      <div class="note">You can't remove your own account while signed in — have another admin remove you, or add a second admin first as a safety net.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>SF LGBT Bowlers — Admin</footer>
</body>
</html>